====
Libraries add the controls, registers, and processes to the home. Answer the questions, and the home shows the libraries that it needs. Click an answer to change it.

[cols="6,2,5"]
|===
| Question | Answer | Libraries that the answer "yes" requires

| Does an existing ISMS outside this home already do the central security work for this home, for example the security roles, the vulnerability reports, and the incident notifications?
| {{#field}}"field": "ismsa/fieldTypes/homeExistingIsms", "display": "inline", "showLabel": false{{/field}}
| No: security response and compliance basics. Yes: none, because the existing ISMS does that work

| Must the products in the scope of this home meet the EU Cyber Resilience Act?
| {{#field}}"field": "ismsa/fieldTypes/homeCra", "display": "inline", "showLabel": false{{/field}}
| Security response and compliance basics, unless an existing ISMS does the central security work

| Does this home manage the risks of the assets of the organisation?
| {{#field}}"field": "ismsa/fieldTypes/homeAssetRisks", "display": "inline", "showLabel": false{{/field}}
| Asset and risk management

| Does the organisation run IT or cloud services itself?
| {{#field}}"field": "ismsa/fieldTypes/homeOwnServices", "display": "inline", "showLabel": false{{/field}}
| Security operations

| Does this home need a full information security management system, for example for ISO/IEC 27001?
| {{#field}}"field": "ismsa/fieldTypes/homeFullIsms", "display": "inline", "showLabel": false{{/field}}
| Information security management, and asset and risk management

| Does NIS2 apply to the organisation?
| {{#field}}"field": "ismsa/fieldTypes/homeNis2", "display": "inline", "showLabel": false{{/field}}
| NIS2. Also the four other libraries, unless an existing ISMS does the central security work
